OL,3,GNEWSAMen held in major incident near
OL,4,ARAF Fairford as homes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK counter-terrorism police are leading
OL,7,Fan investigation in which five men were
OL,8,Farrested on suspicion of explosives
OL,9,Foffences near an RAF base which hosts
OL,10,Fthe United States Air Force (USAF).
OL,12,FAn Army explosive ordnance disposal
OL,13,Fteam has been examining vehicles near
OL,14,FRAF Fairford in Gloucestershire after
OL,15,Fpolice received a call at about 00:45
OL,16,FBST on Sunday morning relating to
OL,17,F"three suspicious vehicles" travelling
OL,18,Fto the base.
OL,20,FHomes in the nearby village of Whelford
OL,21,Fhave been evacuated while
OL,22,Finvestigations continue.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
