OL,3,GNEWSAMen held in major incident near
OL,4,ARAF Fairford as homes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe men were detained early on Sunday
OL,7,Fand a Hazardous Area Response Team has
OL,8,Fbeen deployed inside a security cordon
OL,9,Fat the base but officers believe the
OL,10,Fincident is contained.
